---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Community" description="Join the Network Academy community. Share labs, connect with other learners, and get help on Discord.">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">Community</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-lg text-muted">Learn together, share what you build, and ask questions in a friendly space.</p>

    <!-- Discord -->
    <section class="mt-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">Connect on Discord</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-muted">Join our community server to chat with other network engineers, share labs, ask questions, and stay updated on new content.</p>
      <a
        href="https://discord.gg/networkacademy"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-lg bg-accent px-6 py-3 font-medium text-accent-fg hover:bg-accent/90"
      >
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M20.317 4.492c-1.53-.742-3.17-1.297-4.885-1.515a.074.074 0 0 0-.079.037c-.211.375-.445.864-.607 1.25a18.565 18.565 0 0 0-5.487 0c-.162-.386-.396-.875-.607-1.25a.077.077 0 0 0-.079-.037A19.738 19.738 0 0 0 3.677 4.492a.07.07 0 0 0-.032.027C.533 9.046-.32 13.58.099 18.057a.082.082 0 0 0 .031.057 19.9 19.9 0 0 0 5.993 3.03.078.078 0 0 0 .084-.028 14.975 14.975 0 0 0 1.293-2.1.073.073 0 0 0-.041-.1 13.122 13.122 0 0 1-1.881-.9.074.074 0 0 1 .009-.123c.126-.093.252-.19.372-.287a.074.074 0 0 1 .076-.01c3.928 1.793 8.18 1.793 12.062 0a.074.074 0 0 1 .078.009c.12.098.246.195.372.288a.074.074 0 0 1 .009.123 13.082 13.082 0 0 1-1.881.9.073.073 0 0 0-.041.1c.36.687.772 1.341 1.292 2.1a.074.074 0 0 0 .084.028 19.963 19.963 0 0 0 6.002-3.03.073.073 0 0 0 .03-.057c.505-4.565-.838-8.535-3.562-12.047a.06.06 0 0 0-.031-.027zM8.02 15.33c-1.183 0-2.157-.967-2.157-2.156 0-1.193.974-2.157 2.157-2.157 1.193 0 2.169.974 2.157 2.157 0 1.189-.974 2.156-2.157 2.156zm7.975 0c-1.183 0-2.157-.967-2.157-2.156 0-1.193.974-2.157 2.157-2.157 1.193 0 2.169.974 2.157 2.157 0 1.189-.964 2.156-2.157 2.156z"/>
        </svg>
        Join our Discord server
      </a>
    </section>

    <!-- Code of Conduct -->
    <section class="mt-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">Code of Conduct</h2>
      <div class="prose prose-neutral mt-4 dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
        <p>Our community is built on respect, learning, and collaboration. Everyone is welcome, regardless of background or experience level.</p>
        <h3>We expect:</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Respect:</strong> Treat everyone with kindness and professionalism, even when you disagree.</li>
          <li><strong>Curiosity:</strong> Assume good faith. If something seems unclear, ask for clarification rather than making assumptions.</li>
          <li><strong>Generosity:</strong> Help others when you can. Sharing what you know builds everyone up.</li>
          <li><strong>Humility:</strong> Everyone is learning. Network engineering is deep; corrections are gifts.</li>
          <li><strong>Patience:</strong> Questions from beginners are just as valid as from experts. Be welcoming.</li>
        </ul>
        <h3>We don't tolerate:</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Harassment, discrimination, or abuse of any kind</li>
          <li>Spam or commercial promotion without permission</li>
          <li>Sharing of passwords, credentials, or sensitive company information</li>
          <li>Deliberately misleading or false information</li>
        </ul>
        <p><strong>Violations:</strong> If you see behavior that breaks this code, report it to the moderators. We take these issues seriously and will take action as needed.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Share Your Labs -->
    <section class="mt-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">Share Your Labs</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-muted">
        Build something in one of our interactive labs or the config generator? Share it with the community:
      </p>
      <div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold">Step 1: Download your config</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">Use the "Download my lab config" button in any lab or tool to export your .rsc file.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold">Step 2: Document what you built</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">Write a brief note about what you learned: what did you change, and why? What was tricky?</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold">Step 3: Share on Discord</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">Post your config file and notes in <code>#labs</code>. We'd love to see what you built!</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold">Step 4: Learn from others</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">Comment on others' labs. Ask questions. Discuss different approaches and trade-offs.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- User-Generated Content Guidelines -->
    <section class="mt-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">Guidelines for User Content</h2>
      <div class="prose prose-neutral mt-4 dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
        <p>When you share labs or config files, keep these things in mind:</p>
        <h3>Do:</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Explain what your config does in plain English</li>
          <li>Document any non-standard choices or interesting design decisions</li>
          <li>Test your config before sharing (or note where it's incomplete)</li>
          <li>Give credit if you adapted someone else's work</li>
          <li>Ask for feedback—the community loves helping improve things</li>
        </ul>
        <h3>Don't:</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Share configs with real credentials, passwords, or API keys</li>
          <li>Post configs from your production network without scrubbing sensitive details</li>
          <li>Share content that violates your employer's or ISP's policies</li>
          <li>Claim credit for work that isn't yours</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Remember: shared content helps everyone learn. Be thoughtful about what you're sharing.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Questions & Help -->
    <section class="mt-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">Questions? Stuck?</h2>
      <div class="prose prose-neutral mt-4 dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
        <p>
          The best place to ask is Discord. The community is helpful and responds quickly. You can also:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Check the lesson's discussion thread—someone may have asked the same question</li>
          <li>Re-read the lesson and any linked documentation</li>
          <li>Try the command or step on a real router or in GNS3 to see what happens</li>
          <li>Break the problem into smaller pieces</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          If you think you found a bug in the site or a lesson, please <a href="https://github.com/networkacademy/site/issues">open an issue on GitHub</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Call to action -->
    <section class="mt-12 rounded-lg border-2 border-accent bg-accent/5 p-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">Ready to join?</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-muted">
        New members are always welcome. Come chat with us, share what you're learning, and help others along the way.
      </p>
      <a
        href="https://discord.gg/networkacademy"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="mt-4 inline-block rounded-lg bg-accent px-6 py-2 font-medium text-accent-fg hover:bg-accent/90"
      >
        Join Discord
      </a>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
